Z||000000||hugh||09-11-2001||08:21 PM||||Today has been an extremely emotional day for people all over the world.It has been a very hard day for me.I would see a scene on tv of New York's World Trade Center and some reporter describing the chaos and it was hard not to break down.Recently I started a thread on this forum and got into some arguements with other members.It made me think,that stuff is so unimportant.I'm home,my family is safe,some fathers are not coming home,some wives are not coming home,brothers,sisters,daughters,sons died horrific deaths.The only reason they died was because of the hate of some for the American people or American government.It is beyond my abilty to comprehend that someone could hate so much they would take what in the final count could be thousands of lives.My prayers go out for all the people,victims and the heros who gave their lives trying to help them.||||reg||9
Z||000001||Raydar||09-11-2001||09:06 PM||||I have been reading posts here all day, and watching the events unfold on TV.<BR>I haven't commented on any of this because I am just stunned, and truthfully don't know WHAT to say. Therefore, I will say very little.<BR>My thoughts and prayers are with the victims and their loved ones, the rest of America, and all those who are touched by this. <BR>Good night all. Stay safe.<P>Steve<BR>||||reg||9
